{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Puzzle Game With Math and Monkeys! Become the top banana!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406930/extras/8a7cf3bed5465a6dee9bb09b042ee6ce.avif?t=1757264709\" width=620 height=70 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Classic Mode</strong> is directly inspired by DK Jr. Math.  Match the number by using arithmetic at your disposal.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406930/extras/54357782e5787349aa79f63e54e3209c.poster.avif?t=1757264709\" width=609 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406930/extras/54357782e5787349aa79f63e54e3209c.webm?t=1757264709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br></li><li> <strong>Endless math equations to solve!</strong> Solve random addition, subtraction, multiplication, division, count the fruit, solve for X, find the prime number! Hone your mathematical skills with harder challenges and complete them in a faster time and aim to beat your high score.<br>Exercise mini-games!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406930/extras/51657d5c8b810beffb888bf8476f5672.poster.avif?t=1757264709\" width=609 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406930/extras/51657d5c8b810beffb888bf8476f5672.webm?t=1757264709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406930/extras/ca601c1aafd688846cf16d134fa3d6a0.poster.avif?t=1757264709\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406930/extras/ca601c1aafd688846cf16d134fa3d6a0.webm?t=1757264709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>4 classic levels for solo or two player mode.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406930/extras/6bff3474f26de53824536cd73f10d376.poster.avif?t=1757264709\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406930/extras/6bff3474f26de53824536cd73f10d376.apng?t=1757264709\" class=\"bb_img\" width=609 height=380 /></picture></span><br></li><li> <strong>Head to Head</strong> Play against your friends online (through Remote Play, for now) or local couch pvp to show off how quickly you can solve math equations.</li></ul></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406930/extras/0731e9de5b7a7b8926a4d2ce86d7df71.avif?t=1757264709\" width=620 height=70 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features to release during Early Access, before v1.0</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Level system</strong> Progressively harder 'worlds' and levels to progress through.<br></li><li> <strong>More equations and math variety.</strong> Long multiplication, division, more trigonometry, etc.<br></li><li> <strong>More achievements!</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Online head-to-head on all levels</strong><br></li><li> <strong>More game settings to customize and tweak</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Monkey customization (maybe hats)</strong></li></ul></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Equation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2406930/f7df0f400920fde106dea77c4b68f32382094655.jpg"},{"name":"Well Read","path":"htt